  "account": "开卷读书",
  "source_title": "如果你梦到逝去的亲人，那么请你一定要好好珍惜这难得的相遇。愿天上亲人，安息珍重，世上人间，岁岁平安。#情感共鸣#智慧人生#中元节#人生感悟#传统民俗#传统文化#思念亲人",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 98.403991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "如果你梦到逝去的亲人，请你一定要好好珍惜这难得的相遇。不管在梦里他是什么模样，以何种方式出现，沉默也好，温柔也罢，这或许都是他付出了巨大的代价，才能够来到你的梦里。也有可能是他拼尽全力跨越时空，穿越时空，不畏艰难，跨越回应，只为悄悄的来见你一面，看看你过得还好不好？故人入我，梦明，我常相忆。你有没有想过，他为何不去其他亲朋好友的梦？偏偏只来你的梦里，这是巧合吗？因为你是他最放心不下，也是他这辈子最思念最相信的人。接受了离别，却低估的思念，过去陪我一同祭拜的人，变成了如今我为他祭拜的人。我们总有太多的来不及接的人，还能再见，而有的人却再也不见了。我们总以为有太多的来日方长，却不知世事无常，就此一别，再无归期，从此相见，只在梦里。若你在生活中有惊无险，在困境中总能化险为夷，这或许就是你的梦中人在跨越时空庇佑，你请你记得感恩。Ok,最后见天上亲人安息，斟酌，世上人间岁岁平安。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 2070,
      "text": "如果你梦到逝去的亲人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2330,
      "end_ms": 5070,
      "text": "请你一定要好好珍惜这难得的相遇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5370,
      "end_ms": 7330,
      "text": "不管在梦里他是什么模样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7470,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "以何种方式出现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9290,
      "end_ms": 10150,
      "text": "沉默也好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10470,
      "end_ms": 11350,
      "text": "温柔也罢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11730,
      "end_ms": 14630,
      "text": "这或许都是他付出了巨大的代价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15110,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "才能够来到你的梦里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17310,
      "end_ms": 20690,
      "text": "也有可能是他拼尽全力跨越时空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21010,
      "end_ms": 21890,
      "text": "穿越时空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22010,
      "end_ms": 22770,
      "text": "不畏艰难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23110,
      "end_ms": 23970,
      "text": "跨越回应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24270,
      "end_ms": 26610,
      "text": "只为悄悄的来见你一面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26970,
      "end_ms": 28530,
      "text": "看看你过得还好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29550,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "故人入我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30480,
      "end_ms": 31360,
      "text": "梦明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31360,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "我常相忆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33420,
      "end_ms": 34300,
      "text": "你有没有想过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34620,
      "end_ms": 37120,
      "text": "他为何不去其他亲朋好友的梦？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37400,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "偏偏只来你的梦里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39100,
      "end_ms": 40160,
      "text": "这是巧合吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "因为你是他最放心不下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43100,
      "end_ms": 47040,
      "text": "也是他这辈子最思念最相信的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47620,
      "end_ms": 48600,
      "text": "接受了离别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49200,
      "end_ms": 50460,
      "text": "却低估的思念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51260,
      "end_ms": 52980,
      "text": "过去陪我一同祭拜的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53140,
      "end_ms": 56080,
      "text": "变成了如今我为他祭拜的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00028",
      "start_ms": 56800,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "text": "我们总有太多的来不及接的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00029",
      "start_ms": 59260,
      "end_ms": 59915,
      "text": "还能再见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00030",
      "start_ms": 60250,
      "end_ms": 63370,
      "text": "而有的人却再也不见了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00031",
      "start_ms": 63490,
      "end_ms": 66010,
      "text": "我们总以为有太多的来日方长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00032",
      "start_ms": 66510,
      "end_ms": 68645,
      "text": "却不知世事无常，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00033",
      "start_ms": 69170,
      "end_ms": 70235,
      "text": "就此一别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00034",
      "start_ms": 70830,
      "end_ms": 71965,
      "text": "再无归期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00035",
      "start_ms": 72370,
      "end_ms": 73870,
      "text": "从此相见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00036",
      "start_ms": 73930,
      "end_ms": 74845,
      "text": "只在梦里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00037",
      "start_ms": 75920,
      "end_ms": 78095,
      "text": "若你在生活中有惊无险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00038",
      "start_ms": 78490,
      "end_ms": 81075,
      "text": "在困境中总能化险为夷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00039",
      "start_ms": 81460,
      "end_ms": 85230,
      "text": "这或许就是你的梦中人在跨越时空庇佑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00040",
      "start_ms": 85230,
      "end_ms": 87165,
      "text": "你请你记得感恩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00041",
      "start_ms": 87480,
      "end_ms": 87850,
      "text": "Ok,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00042",
      "start_ms": 88110,
      "end_ms": 90910,
      "text": "最后见天上亲人安息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00043",
      "start_ms": 90970,
      "end_ms": 91555,
      "text": "斟酌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_451c49d2a1ebc624_s00044",
      "start_ms": 92080,
      "end_ms": 95835,
      "text": "世上人间岁岁平安。"
    }
  ],
